# src/application/

Orchestrates domain logic. Depends on ports (interfaces), not concrete
implementations. No HTTP or database knowledge.

- `services/` — application services (use-cases); may use `@Injectable()`
- `ports/` — DI tokens + domain interface re-exports; messaging port
- `dto/` — request validation shapes (class-validator or Zod)

**Rule:** Application layer may depend on `domain/` and `ports/`, but never
on `infrastructure/` or `presentation/`.
